<p><a name="footnote3"></a><sup>3</sup> For a discussion of various financial conditions indexes see Jan Hatzius, Peter  Hooper, Frederic S. Mishkin, Kermit L. Schoenholtz, and Mark W. Watson, &ldquo;<a href="https://research.chicagobooth.edu/~/media/1338DA6CAC704236B85695F141B503C6.pdf">Financial  Conditions Indexes: A Fresh Look after the Financial Crisis</a>,&rdquo; U.S. Monetary  Policy Forum (Chicago: Chicago Booth Initiative on Global Markets, 2010) pp.  3-59.</p>

